@startuml Delete Competition

actor Organizer
participant Frontend
participant Backend
participant Database

Organizer -> Frontend: Delete competition
Frontend -> Backend: DELETE /api/v1/competitions/{id}
Backend -> Database: Verify organizer ownership
alt Not owner
  Backend --> Frontend: 403 Forbidden
  Frontend --> Organizer: Show error
else
  Backend -> Database: Delete competition
  Database --> Backend: Competition deleted
  Backend --> Frontend: 204 No Content
  Frontend --> Organizer: Show success
end
@enduml
